Package: libnginx-mod-http-auth-ldap
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: LDAP authentication module for nginx
 Checks HTTP Basic credentials against LDAP servers: finds the user DN,
 checks require user / require group rules, binds as the user to verify
 the password, and caches the results. Supports ldap://, ldaps://,
 StartTLS and ldapi://, several servers with failover, and passes the DN
 and attributes of the user on in variables.
